# Marooned's `S:Mode$ CantBeBeamedUp` makes the enchanted creature ineligible
# for Beam me up's return (the canBeBeamedUp valid property), so a board whose
# only creature is Marooned cannot pay the cost.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 U
tapformana human 3 U
tapformana human 4 U
castspell human 1
